We need code similar to `metalog_pluginsd_chart_action()` and `metalog_pluginsd_dimension_action()` like this:
```
    if (host) { /* It's a valid object */
        struct metalog_record record;
        struct metadata_logfile *metalogfile = state->metalogfile;

        uuid_copy(record.uuid, host->host_uuid);
        mlf_record_insert(metalogfile, &record);
    }

```

This is needed so that during log replay, the necessary `struct metalog_record` is created so that afterwards compaction won't miss it.
